    "body": "## Overview\r\nDraft-model initialization with speculative decoding can fail during mixed prefill/decode warmup:\r\n```\r\nAssertionError: Shape: 2050 out of considered ranges: [(1, 2048)]\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe warmup creates one synthetic decode request and one synthetic prefill request, but builds the scheduler inputs directly and bypasses the scheduler's correction-slot reservation. The extra query slots for these requests were missing from the warmup token budget, allowing the resulting shape to exceed max_num_tokens.\r\n\r\nWhen a speculator is enabled, cap the warmup token count at max_num_tokens - num_warmup_reqs * num_extra_query_per_req. Skip the warmup if the adjusted budget is too small for a mixed step.\r\n\r\nThis fixes a regression in the mixed warmup path added by [#56492](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/56492).\r\n\r\n## Validation\r\n```\r\nvllm serve /shared/models/modelscope/models/Qwen/Qwen3-32B \\\r\n  --host 0.0.0.0 \\\r\n  --port 8900 \\\r\n  --served-model-name qwen3 \\\r\n  --trust-remote-code \\\r\n  --seed 42 \\\r\n  --tensor-parallel-size 1 \\\r\n  --max-model-len 10000 \\\r\n  --max-num-seqs 32 \\\r\n  --gpu-memory-utilization 0.95 \\\r\n  --no-enable-prefix-caching \\\r\n  --compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_AND_PIECEWISE\"}' \\\r\n  --speculative-config '{\"method\":\"draft_model\",\"model\":\"/shared/models/modelscope/models/Qwen/Qwen3-1.7B\",\"num_speculative_tokens\":3}'\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n",
